                "description": "Sandcast Bronze Egg Door Knob Fusion 06 - Fusion Hardware's Egg Knob is designed to fit comfortably in the hand while still looking great. Made out of bronze, it is available in a dark bronze finish, medium bronze finish, or a antique pewter finish--all of which emphasize the rustic beauty of the sandcast bronze material from which this door knob has been carefully crafted. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n\r\n",
